/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Kshamtalaya was envisaged in 2016 after witnessing the widespread inequalities in the most underserved communities of tribal-rural Rajasthan. We intervene to improve school enrolment, attendance, academic outcomes and life prospects for the students in rural and marginalised settings. We want to actualize a rural India in which children successfully make a transition from compulsory school education to life afterwards and go on to live happy and productive lives.)
/E (Kshamtalaya was envisaged in 2016 after witnessing the widespread inequalities in the most underserved communities of tribal-rural Rajasthan. We intervene to improve school enrolment, attendance, academic outcomes and life prospects for the students in rural and marginalised settings. We want to actualize a rural India in which children successfully make a transition from compulsory school education to life afterwards and go on to live happy and productive lives.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
