/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Teachers play an essential role in the lives of children, and their ability to nurture and lead is grounded in their own emotional stability. Hausla, our 21-day mental well-being series, was developed to equip educators with skills in self-awareness, compassion, emotional regulation, meaningful action, and social connection. The program consists of audio recordings featuring stories, reflections, and exercises, along with a workbook for ongoing practice. Teachers can participate in person or online, fostering a supportive cohort experience.)
/E (Teachers play an essential role in the lives of children, and their ability to nurture and lead is grounded in their own emotional stability. Hausla, our 21-day mental well-being series, was developed to equip educators with skills in self-awareness, compassion, emotional regulation, meaningful action, and social connection. The program consists of audio recordings featuring stories, reflections, and exercises, along with a workbook for ongoing practice. Teachers can participate in person or online, fostering a supportive cohort experience.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
309 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Our first cohort of Well-beingpreneurs in Rajasthan saw significant improvements. 69% of participants reported increased well-being on the WHO-5 Wellbeing Index, 59% showed enhanced mindfulness abilities on the Kentucky Inventory of Mindfulness Skills, and 38% demonstrated greater resilience on the Connor-Davidson Resilience Scale. Hausla empowers teachers to create compassionate classrooms, even amid daily stressors, reflecting our commitment to holistic teacher support and the broader well-being of school communities.)
/E (Our first cohort of Well-beingpreneurs in Rajasthan saw significant improvements. 69% of participants reported increased well-being on the WHO-5 Wellbeing Index, 59% showed enhanced mindfulness abilities on the Kentucky Inventory of Mindfulness Skills, and 38% demonstrated greater resilience on the Connor-Davidson Resilience Scale. Hausla empowers teachers to create compassionate classrooms, even amid daily stressors, reflecting our commitment to holistic teacher support and the broader well-being of school communities.)
